TYPE"],"可選擇哪些類型的座位？",null,[[[["E:DINING_SEATING_TYPE_INDOOR_DINING_AREA"],"室內用餐區",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiS0Nnb-9mWAxWVMDQIHdiCMwIQ3YcHCDwoAA"]]],null,"座位類型",null,"0ahUKEwiS0Nnb-9mWAxWVMDQIHdiCMwIQ3IcHCDsoBg",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["麵屋和和\n雞湯醬油拉麵\n\n雞湯底熬得濃醇，醬油的鹹味拿捏得恰到好處，不會過重也不會寡淡。整體風格偏向台式口味，少了一點日式拉麵的稜角，但意外地很對胃，喝起來舒服親切。\n\n叉燒提供雞肉與雞腿兩種選擇，兩者的肉質與口感都有一定水準，算是這碗裡讓人滿意的部分。\n\n豆芽給很多很爽\n\n整體而言是一碗樸實卻不失水準的拉麵，沒有太多花俏的設計，但該有的都有、而且吃完滿足感不低。有機會的話想再回訪試試其他口味。\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b",null,[0,11]]]],[null,1782652292000000,1782652292000000,"2 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfVnctVGdZYlZRSWNyV2lKS1E2UEtwZw%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfVnctVGdZYlZRSWNyV2lKS1E2UEtwZxoTQ2d3SWhMdUUwZ1lRdTl5WDB3TQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwiS0Nnb-9mWAxWVMDQIHdiCMwIQ_2MIPSgH"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/12076173757311552852/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnROZWsxNlVtRlBWVkY1VjFkV1JWbHVhSEZrYmtaUlltMXdVRnBHUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12076173757311552852/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnROZWsxNlVtRlBWVkY1VjFkV1JWbHVhSEZrYmtaUlltMXdVRnBHUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/12076173757311552852/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnROZWsxNlVtRlBWVkY1VjFkV1JWbHVhSEZrYmtaUlltMXdVRnBHUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12076173757311552852/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnROZWsxNlVtRlBWVkY1VjFkV1JWbHVhSEZrYmtaUlltMXdVRnBHUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12076173757311552852/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnROZWsxNlVtRlBWVkY1VjFkV1JWbHVhSEZrYmtaUlltMXdVRnBHUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12076173757311552852/customers/rev